{"product_id":"dinner-lady-salts-cool-tobacco","title":"Dinner Lady Salts Cool Tobacco","description":"\u003cp\u003eCool Tobacco by Dinner Lady, in particular, incorporates strong and sharp notes of icy menthol, delivering a chilling sensation alongside the robust notes of woody tobacco. As such, it is tailor-made for ex-smokers with a penchant for mint cigarettes, but with the smooth throat hit you come to expect from Dinner Lady’s products.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50% VG \/ 50% PG\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSalt Nicotine Blends\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade In The UK\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChildproof Cap\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Dinner Lady","offers":[{"title":"30MG","offer_id":42016304857143,"sku":"Dinner Lady Cool Tobacco - 30 MG","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":42016304889911,"sku":"Dinner Lady Cool Tobacco - 50 MG","price":1499.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/cool-tobacco-dinner-lady-salt.webp?v=1765243646","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/dinner-lady-salts-cool-tobacco","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




